id=morphe-autodetach
name=Morphe Auto-Detach
version=v1.2.0
versionCode=10200
author=aaronmurniadi
description=Keeps every Morphe root-mount app detached from Google Play Store, so Play cannot replace the patched APK. Uses an installed zygisk-detach module when present, otherwise its own bundled engine.
